      "prompt": "Image 1 is a sticker of one giant round leaf on a thick green stalk; image 2 shows it cut into puppet pieces. Draw ONE piece on its own, at the size piece 3 has in image 2 (the stalk's foot, bottom left), the same drawing style, colours, texture and line: the little pointed sheath leaves at the foot of the stalk and the short curl of new leaf beside them, exactly as at the bottom of image 1, all joined in one piece at their bottoms, but with NO stalk and nothing at all between the two front pointed leaves: no cup, no rim, no inner opening, no stalk end — the space between and above them is empty and fully transparent, so a stalk standing behind them shows between them. Their bottom edge is one smooth rounded line, as in image 1. It is a plant, not a character: no face, no eyes, no mouth. No text, no labels, no shadows, no ground. Fully transparent background."
    }
